  "strings": [
   {
    "len": 716,
    "text": "BloxdSurfaceEach textureId has a name: bloxdTextureId followed by its texture pack filename, e.g. bloxdTextureIdGrassTop for grass_top.png. For animated textures,skip the frame number, e.g. bloxdTextu"
   },
   {
    "len": 546,
    "text": "terrainmodelsundefinedDefined for liquids, enabling bloxdOpaqueBehind().Defined for liquids and non-strict games.Defined in strict games, which enforce visibility.bloxdFragmentBlockPositionbloxdShadow"
   },
   {
    "len": 455,
    "text": "Packs can't declare names starting with bloxd, other than the hook functions bloxd<Terrain|Liquid|Model><Vertex|Surface|Light>.WGSL names can't start with two underscores._ can only be the target of a"
   },
   {
    "len": 430,
    "text": "A line starting with # must be #define, #ifdef, #ifndef, #else or #endif.defineifdefifndefelseendifThis #ifdef or #ifndef already has an #else.#define takes only a flag name; values use const.Names st"
   },
   {
    "len": 390,
    "text": "pack_var<private> bloxdValidationP: vec4f;    let p = bloxdValidationP;@vertexfn bloxdValidateVertex(@builtin(vertex_index) i: u32) -> @builtin(position) vec4f {    let p = vec4f(f32(i));    return ve"
   },
   {
    "len": 299,
    "text": "Sunlight or moonlight reaching this fragment: 0 in shadow, 1 lit. Blocks,players, mobs and items cast shadows. Fades to 0 as the sun or moon sets, oras the face turns away from it. 1 on flags.emissive"
   },
   {
    "len": 268,
    "text": "called `Option::unwrap()` on a `None` value0001020304050607080910111213141516171819202122232425262728293031323334353637383940414243444546474849505152535455565758596061626364656667686970717273747576777"
   },
   {
    "len": 226,
    "text": "Using a fragment's position and normal, identify the block's world position.Terrain looks half a block behind the face, and models 1/64 behind. Wherethat point is inside a placed block model's own blo"
   },
   {
    "len": 202,
    "text": "BloxdOpaqueBehindLike bloxdShadow, but at a point between the camera (t = 0) and thisfragment (t = 1), e.g. for light shafts. Only blocks cast these shadows,blurred to whole blocks. t is clamped to 0-"
   },
   {
    "len": 189,
    "text": "bloxdTerrainVertexbloxdTerrainSurfacebloxdTerrainLightbloxdLiquidVertexbloxdLiquidSurfacebloxdLiquidLightbloxdModelVertexbloxdModelSurfacebloxdModelLightbloxdDefaultSurfacebloxdDefaultLight"
   },
